		line=584,
	},
	{
		{"mwf"},
		{"msgoff"},
		{"bg", del=2, lv=0, id=31, path=":bg/", file="black", time=1000, wait=500, sync=1},
		{"bgm", stop=1, [1]="", time=1500},
		{"excall", call=0, file="hat050180"},
		line=584,
	},
	text={
		[1]={
			{
"A miracle. That is all it could be described as.",
			},
		},
		[2]={
			{
"A blinding ray of light descends from the sun above before being redirected, as though by divine will─",
			},
		},
		[3]={
			{
"To strike down the priestess named Yagi Sekka.",
			},
		},
		[4]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“Kh...! I-It cannot be...”",
			},
		},
		[5]={
			{
"A gaping wound piercing her stomach, Sekka stumbles several steps forward in disbelief before collapsing to the ground.",
			},
		},
		[6]={
			{
"Kotone simply stares vacantly at the scene before her.",
			},
		},
		[7]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin & Akari"},
			{
"“Kotone!” “Kotone!”",
			},
		},
		[8]={
			{
"By sheer force of will, I pick my leaden body off the ground and rush up to Kotone.",
			},
		},
		[9]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Soujin-sama... Akari-sama...”",
			},
		},
		[10]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Are you okay?”",
			},
		},
		[11]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Y-Yes, I am quite all right...”",
			},
		},
		[12]={
			{
"Kotone slowly blinks her unfocused eyes, as though rousing herself from a waking dream.",
			},
		},
		[13]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“This is... primeval magicks...”",
			},
		},
		[14]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“The truest manifestation of Oomikami's divinity... a miracle wrought free of any karmic distortions...”",
			},
		},
		[15]={
			{
"Sekka murmurs in shocked admiration.",
			},
		},
		[16]={
			{
"Her uniform is soon stained with fresh crimson.",
			},
		},
		[17]={
			{
"It is obvious from a glance that she is not long for this world.",
			},
		},
		[18]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Sekka-san... You have my deepest apologies.”",
			},
		},
		[19]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“If only I was able to save you too.”",
			},
		},
		[20]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“Aren't you a goody two-shoes, apologizing to your enemy...”",
			},
		},
		[21]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“No wonder Oomikami listened to your prayer... hah... heheh...”",
			},
		},
		[22]={
			{
"Blood drips from her mouth as she chuckles bitterly to herself.",
			},
		},
		[23]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Sekka-san, stay with me!”",
			},
		},
		[24]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“What a way to go out, being consoled by the Exalt-Priestess of all people...”",
			},
		},
		[25]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“Hey, can I ask you one last thing?”",
			},
		},
		[26]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“First you wish for my death, and now you mourn my passing... what will it take for you to be satisfied?”",
			},
		},
		[27]={
			{
"Sekka spits her question with all the scathing intent she can muster.",
			},
		},
		[28]={
			{
"But Kotone answers her straightforwardly, without ever averting her gaze.",
			},
		},
		[29]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I am the Exalt-Priestess.”",
			},
		},
		[30]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I will never be satisfied until I am able to preserve the well-being of all the people in the Empire.”",
			},
		},
		[31]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I want everyone in the Empire to live each day with a smile on their face.”",
			},
		},
		[32]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“And I want to bring about a kinder world, one where nobody has to shoulder the same sorrows that you have.”",
			},
		},
		[33]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“A kinder world...? Heh... heheh, how ridiculous...”",
			},
		},
		[34]={
			{
"Sekka chuckles as derisively as ever.",
			},
		},
		[35]={
			{
"But the expression she wears is somewhat more at peace than earlier.",
			},
		},
		[36]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“...Inou Hotori is being held in a Republican military base.”",
			},
		},
		[37]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Hotori is alive?!”",
			},
		},
		[38]={
			{
"She says nothing, but her eyes tell me all I need to hear.",
			},
		},
		[39]={
			{
"An unblemished jeweled orb tumbles out of Sekka's hand and comes to a rest on the ground.",
			},
		},
		[40]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“My predecessor's orb...!”",
			},
		},
		[41]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“Shiinoha Kotone...”",
			},
		},
		[42]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“If you really want to make that kind world of yours into reality... protect that orb with your life.”",
			},
		},
		[43]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Y-Yes!”",
			},
		},
		[44]={
			{
"Kotone picks up the orb and cradles it tightly to her chest.",
			},
		},
		[45]={
			name={"name", name="Sekka"},
			{
"“I'm sorry... but I'll be going on without you... Rochel-sama...”",
			},
		},
		[46]={
			{
"Her voice slowly fades into nothingness.",
			},
		},
		[47]={
			{
"Until, with one last, final gasp, Sekka breathes her last.",
			},
		},
		[48]={
			{
"The moment she expires, a chill wind passes us by.",
			},
		},
		[49]={
			{
"And with it, a malefic, spine-chilling presence seemingly settles in the clearing.",
			},
		},
		[50]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Who's there...?”",
			},
		},
		[51]={
			{
"I hear a faint whistling through the trees.",
			},
		},
		[52]={
			{
"But even as I look around, I'm unable to sense anyone at all.",
			},
		},
		[53]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“...Just my imagination.”",
			},
		},
		[54]={
			{
"The sense of insidious dread dissipates in an instant─",
			},
		},
		[55]={
			{
"Leaving behind only the sound of frigid wind rustling the late-autumn leaves.",
			},
		},
		[56]={
			{
"With the battle over, an air of tranquility is restored to Inner Iseya.",
			},
		},
		[57]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Isuzu, it's all thanks to you that we were able to defend Inner Iseya.”",
			},
		},
		[58]={
			name={"name", name="Isuzu"},
			{
"“Your praise is far too generous.”",
			},
		},
		[59]={
			name={"name", name="Isuzu"},
			{
"“Indeed, had Soujin-sama failed to slay Kokuan-dono, all of Inner Iseya would surely have fallen.”",
			},
		},
		[60]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Isuzu, how much damage have we suffered?”",
			},
		},
		[61]={
			name={"name", name="Isuzu"},
			{
"“Of our approximately three hundred defenders, only around fifty are still in any fighting condition.”",
			},
		},
		[62]={
			name={"name", name="Isuzu"},
			{
"“With the exception of the Chancel Shrine, all of the other temples have taken extensive damage, and the spellwards protecting Inner Iseya have weakened considerably.”",
			},
		},
		[63]={
			name={"name", name="Isuzu"},
			{
"“With all things considered, I believe it will be unwise to continue using this place as a base of operations.”",
			},
		},
		[64]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Oh, I see...”",
			},
		},
		[65]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Let us conduct a proper memorial service for all those who lost their lives.”",
			},
		},
		[66]={
			{
"Kotone murmurs sorrowfully, not looking up from the ground.",
			},
		},
		[67]={
			{
"Though the dead willingly gave their lives for our cause, theirs is still a most tragic fate.",
			},
		},
		[68]={
			{
"No one can think of anything to say, and an oppressive silence descends upon the Chancel Shrine.",
			},
		},
		[69]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“...”",
			},
		},
		[70]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Soujin, let's return to Tenkyo.”",
			},
		},
		[71]={
			{
"Akari is the first to break the silence.",
			},
		},
		[72]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“But we haven't been able to unlock Himi-no-Mikoto's power yet.”",
			},
		},
		[73]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Inou is still being held captive. We can hardly leave her there, can we?”",
			},
		},
		[74]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I feel the same way, but what if we have another run-in with the Republican Army?”",
			},
		},
		[75]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Once they find out their expeditionary force has been annihilated, don't you think they'll go on the defensive?”",
			},
		},
		[76]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Besides, you've gotten back most of Mitsurugi's power,\nhaven't you?”",
			},
		},
		[77]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Yeah, no doubt about it.”",
			},
		},
		[78]={
			{
"It's a dangerous gambit, but I don't want to leave behind any regrets.",
			},
		},
		[79]={
			{
"Besides, now that our location has been discovered, we\ncan't hope to hole up here in Inner Iseya forever.",
			},
		},
		[80]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“All right.”",
			},
		},
		[81]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“It's decided, then.”",
			},
		},
		[82]={
			{
"I stand up together with Akari.",
			},
		},
		[83]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“P-Please do not be so hasty!”",
			},
		},
		[84]={
			{
"Kotone stands up in a panic.",
			},
		},
		[85]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“The both of you have suffered injuries, so please allow us to at least treat you first.”",
			},
		},
		[86]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Good point. I'll be just fine, but Soujin definitely needs some medical attention.”",
			},
		},
		[87]={
			{
"Akari replies, looking over my body.",
			},
		},
		[88]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Also... I would make another request of you.”",
			},
		},
		[89]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Please allow me to accompany the two of you to Tenkyo.”",
			},
		},
		[90]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Take you with us?”",
			},
		},
		[91]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“It's too dangerous. Don't even think about it.”",
			},
		},
		[92]={
			{
"Kotone will surely be exposed to grave danger if we allow her to accompany us.",
			},
		},
		[93]={
			{
"I don't want to put her in harm's way.",
			},
		},
		[94]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Soujin-sama, please do not forget that I am the Exalt-Priestess.”",
			},
		},
		[95]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“My station as Mitsurugi-sama's bride surely grants me the right to accompany you wherever you may go.”",
			},
		},
		[96]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Still, though...”",
			},
		},
		[97]={
			{
"This is a problem.",
			},
		},
		[98]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Even if we tell her no, she'll just follow us anyway.”",
			},
		},
		[99]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“You may certainly count on that!”",
			},
		},
		[100]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You sure about this, Akari?”",
			},
		},
		[101]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“They who choose their own path need never have any regrets.”",
			},
		},
		[102]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Isn't that right?”",
			},
		},
		[103]={
			{
"When she puts it that way, I have nothing else to say.",
			},
		},
		[104]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“All right. It'll be the three of us.”",
			},
		},
		[105]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Hurray! Thank you!”",
			},
		},
		[106]={
			{
"Kotone jumps for joy with a beaming smile.",
			},
		},
		[107]={
			{
"That familiar smile is a sight for sore eyes, instantly lightening the gloomy atmosphere.",
			},
		},
		[108]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Ah, but what shall be done about Iseya?”",
			},
		},
		[109]={
			name={"name", name="Isuzu"},
			{
"“Please entrust everything to me.”",
			},
		},
		[110]={
			{
"Isuzu steps forward with a bow.",
			},
		},
		[111]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Are you sure?”",
			},
		},
		[112]={
			name={"name", name="Isuzu"},
			{
"“I am the superintendent of Iseya, am I not? To safeguard this place is my sworn duty.”",
			},
		},
		[113]={
			name={"name", name="Isuzu"},
			{
"“Besides, having the Exalt-Priestess around would only make for one extra hungry mouth to feed.”",
			},
		},
		[114]={
			{
"Isuzu directs a teasing smile at Kotone.",
			},
		},
		[115]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Ooh... You are always so mean to me...”",
			},
		},
		[116]={
			name={"name", name="Isuzu"},
			{
"“The Exalt-Priestess belongs in her proper place, in the Imperial Temple at Tenkyo.”",
			},
		},
		[117]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Thank you for everything, Isuzu.”",
			},
		},
		[118]={
			name={"name", name="Isuzu"},
			{
"“I look forward to the day we meet again... Kotone.”",
			},
		},
		[119]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“It's a promise, Isuzu!”",
			},
		},
	},
	label={
	},
}
